{"id":"solicitud","lemma":"solicitud","pos":"noun","rank":2643,"glosses":["request, solicitation","survey","application (a verbal or written request for assistance or employment or admission to a school, course or similar)"],"ipa":"/soliθiˈtud/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"solicitudes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-solicitud.wav","examples":[{"text":"Quisiera hacer una solicitud.","en":"I would like to make a request.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él envió su solicitud a la oficina.","en":"He sent in his application to the office.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689407","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to send","l":"enviar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"office"}]},{"text":"Nuestra solicitud fue aprobada.","en":"Our request was approved.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582463","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"approved, confirmed","l":"aprobado"}]},{"text":"Las solicitudes vencen el lunes.","en":"Applications are due by Monday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352062","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to defeat","l":"vencer"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"Monday"}]},{"text":"Acabo de echar mi solicitud.","en":"I just turned in my application.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/532305","words":[{"g":"synonym of acabamiento"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to throw"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}